    {
      "title": "Casting On",
      "slug": "casting-on",
      "displayOrder": 2,
      "legacy": {
        "itemId": 438,
        "lessonOrder": 2
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "Casting on with your ribber can be intimidating. Have you followed the instructions with your machine and not been happy with the results? Are there too many steps to remember?<br>Here's an easy-to-remember cast on that's not only fast, but it's versatile and can be used for 1x1, 2x2, 5x5, or any stitch combination. In addition, it has plenty of elasticity for armholes, neckbands ... anywhere you want stretch.<br>Quick, easy, fast, stretchy, versatile, pretty Ribber Cast On .. what more could you want?<br><i class=\"fa fa-lightbulb-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <em>This technique uses a \r\n\r\n<a data-GlossaryId='372' class='glossaryhelp'>Double Eye Needle (Bodkin) <i class='fa fa-question-circle' aria-hidden='true'></i></a><br>\r\nIf you don't have a double eye needle ... <b>buy one</b> (or buy 2 they tend to play hide-and-seek    <i class='fa fa-smile-o' aria-hidden='true'></i>).</em><br>",
              "legacyComponentId": 5834,
              "order": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "video",
              "vimeoId": "151858586",
              "title": "Easiest, Best Ribber Cast On",
              "legacyComponentId": 5833,
              "order": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<br>Although you NEED a double eye needle to work with your ribber, it is possible to transfer stitches using transfer tools.  This can be a quick way to transfer stitches. Give it a try!<br>",
              "legacyComponentId": 5847,
              "order": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "video",
              "vimeoId": "151859491",
              "title": "Transfer without a Double Eye Needle",
              "legacyComponentId": 5848,
              "order": 4
            }
          ],
          "title": "Easist, Best Ribber Cast On",
          "slug": "easist-best-ribber-cast-on",
          "order": 1,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 3907,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<br>\r\n<b>There are many methods for both casting on and binding off when working with the double bed.<br>Your best bet is to try multiple techniques and determine which work for you</b>",
              "legacyComponentId": 5841,
              "order": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "video",
              "vimeoId": "151859232",
              "title": "3 Perfect Ribbing Cast Ons",
