    {
      "title": "Flat Ribs",
      "slug": "flat-ribs",
      "displayOrder": 10,
      "legacy": {
        "itemId": 446,
        "lessonOrder": 10
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "Do you love the look of both knit and purl stitches? Do you love the look of ribbing, but don't need or want the stretch?<br>Maybe your yarn isn't suited for ribbing, but you still want the texture ....\r\n\r\n<b>Flat Ribs are the answer!</b><br>Using the full needle rib setup as the basis, flat ribs fabric and hems have unlimited possibilities!<br>This video introduces you to the technique. The follow up video takes you step by step to mastering it.\r\n<br>You won't look at \"plain 'ol\" ribbing the same way again!<br>",
              "legacyComponentId": 5866,
              "order": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "video",
              "vimeoId": "151858934",
              "title": "Fun with Flat Ribs",
              "legacyComponentId": 5867,
              "order": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<br>\r\nFlat ribs are a serious knitter's staple technique. Follow along as we challenge you with 6 different flat rib configurations.\r\n\r\nYou can view images all day long, but it isn't until you knit, feel and work with flat ribs that you will appreciate their beauty.\r\n\r\nIf you aren't familiar with this technique of creating beautiful hems, trims and all-over fabrics, view part 1 for lots of samples to inspire you!\r\n<br>",
              "legacyComponentId": 5868,
              "order": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "video",
              "vimeoId": "151858938",
              "title": "Fun with Flat Ribs Part 2",
              "legacyComponentId": 5869,
              "order": 4
            }
          ],
          "title": "Flat Rib Fun!",
          "slug": "flat-rib-fun",
          "order": 1,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 3920,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<h3>Flat Rib challenges- Try it Yourself!</h3>\r\n\r\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/downloads/flat_rib_challenges.pdf\"><img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"/images/course-content/66/flat_rib_challenges.jpg\" width=\"200\"><br><i class=\"fa fa-download\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> click to download</a>\r\n\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 6541,
              "order": 2
            }
          ],
